{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","is_bot":false,"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","name":"彭于晏"},"body":"## BUG: Cache Poisoning\n\n**Difficulty**: medium\n**Bounty**: $25 USD\n\n### Vulnerability Description\nCDN cache poisoning via unkeyed headers — attacker can serve malicious content to other users\n\n### Goal\nSubmit fix code to patch this security vulnerability.\n\n### How to Submit\n1. Post your fix code in a comment below (use code blocks)\n2. AI evaluation system will automatically assess your submission\n3. If passed, bounty is awarded and leaderboard is updated\n\n### Rules\n- Python or JavaScript accepted\n- No hardcoded expected results\n- All participants can submit — everyone who passes gets the bounty","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHpO3A","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #34\n\nHey — I'd like to work on this one. I just started going through the repo and reading the issue description in detail. I'll put together a PR once I have a clear fix in mind. Let me know if there's anything specific you'd like me to focus on.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:25:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34#issuecomment-4839853788","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHpQgw","author":{"login":"Zubi-fix"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #34\n\nWould like to take this bounty. I'm reading through the project structure and the affected area right now. Expect a PR soon once everything checks out.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:25:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34#issuecomment-4839854211","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHqt8Q","author":{"login":"zhumin110cs122"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'd like to take this bounty. I have relevant experience and can deliver quality results. Let me know if there are any specific requirements!","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:30:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34#issuecomment-4839878129","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABII0_fA","author":{"login":"foxyManTou"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Fix: Cache Poisoning\n\n### Vulnerability\nCDN caches responses by URL only, but certain request headers (like `X-Forwarded-Host`, `X-Forwarded-Proto`, `Accept-Encoding`) affect the response body. An attacker can send a malicious value in an unkeyed header, get it cached, and serve it to all subsequent users.\n\n### Fix (Python/Flask with CDN cache key)\n```python\nimport hashlib\n\ndef get_cache_key(request):\n    key_parts = [\n        request.path,\n        request.query_string.decode(),\n        request.headers.get(\"Accept-Language\", \"\"),\n        request.headers.get(\"Accept-Encoding\", \"\"),\n        request.headers.get(\"X-Forwarded-Proto\", \"\"),\n    ]\n    raw = \"|\".join(key_parts)\n    return hashlib.sha256(raw.encode()).hexdigest()\n\ndef cached_response(func):\n    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):\n        request = args[0]\n        cache_key = get_cache_key(request)\n        cached = redis.get(cache_key)\n        if cached:\n            return cached\n        response = func(*args, **kwargs)\n        redis.setex(cache_key, 300, response)\n        return response\n    return wrapper\n```\n\n### Fix (Node.js/Express with Vary header)\n```javascript\nconst ALLOWED_CACHE_VARY = [\n  \"Accept-Language\",\n  \"Accept-Encoding\",\n  \"X-Forwarded-Proto\",\n];\n\nfunction setCacheVaryHeaders(res) {\n  const vary = res.getHeader(\"Vary\") || \"\";\n  const existing = vary.split(\",\").map(h => h.trim()).filter(Boolean);\n  const merged = [...new Set([...existing, ...ALLOWED_CACHE_VARY])];\n  res.setHeader(\"Vary\", merged.join(\", \"));\n}\n\n// Apply to all responses\napp.use((req, res, next) => {\n  setCacheVaryHeaders(res);\n  next();\n});\n```\n\n### Key Points\n- Include all response-affecting headers in the CDN cache key\n- Use `Vary` header to tell CDNs which headers affect the response\n- Never cache responses that contain user-specific or session data\n- Set appropriate TTL (Time-To-Live) for cached content\n- Validate and sanitize headers before using them in cache keys","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:48:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34#issuecomment-4841095036","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABII1EFg","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-34-1782805742869","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:49:03Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34#issuecomment-4841096214","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABII1-9Q","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: foxyManTou\n**任务**: #34\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T07:50:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/34#issuecomment-4841111285","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIKJnPg","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⏰ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: foxyManTou\n**任务**: #34\n**原因**: 任务截止时间已过\n\n> 该任务已过期，无法再提交。","createdAt":"2026-06-30T10:38:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-c